  "description": "The sidebar overlay on a query that matches nothing. Before this feature the overlay stayed shut on a zero-hit query; now it opens anyway, leads with the pinned Open Full Search row, and shows No Results BENEATH it rather than instead of it. That ordering is the point: a query with no hits is exactly when a user most wants somewhere else to look, so the one affordance that widens the search has to be the thing they can reach.",
